{
  "maps": {
    "171": {
      "name": "Route 22",
      "events": {
        "35": {
          "name": "Blue",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 59},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN! Hey, you made it out of Pallet!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Routes are wilder than I expected.",
                    "Did you hear the Pidgey? They sound",
                    "different out here."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Anyway -- I've been training already!",
                    "My Pokémon's gotten way stronger."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Come on, let's battle! Just like we",
                    "always talked about!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "36": {
          "name": "Blue",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 59},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN! Hey, you made it out of Pallet!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Routes are wilder than I expected.",
                    "Did you hear the Pidgey? They sound",
                    "different out here."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 16,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Anyway -- I've been training! Want to",
                    "see how much stronger I've gotten?"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "2": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "...Okay. That was actually really good."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You've been catching Pokémon already?",
                    "Smart. You'll need a team."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You should try training some of them",
                    "before Pewter. Brock's no joke."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 12,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You need more Pokémon. A one-mon team",
                    "won't last against a Gym Leader."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Those two look like they could become",
                    "really strong with some training."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 21,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'll be watching out for those!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 26,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Solid team, but you'll need to train",
                    "them up before the Gym Leaders."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 30,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Get some training in on the Routes.",
                    "The wild Pokémon here are good practice."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 35,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "How did you even beat me without a",
                    "Pokémon? I'm impressed. And confused."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 38,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Pretty sure Brock won't accept that",
                    "strategy though!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 43,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I heard Pewter's Gym has some tough",
                    "trainers. I need to prepare."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 46,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Maybe I'll try fusing some of my",
                    "Pokémon before the Gym."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 49,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Here -- take a DNA Splicer. I picked",
                    "up extra at the Mart."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 52,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Alright, I'm heading to Pewter City."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 55,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "See you there, \\PN!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
